{"seq":2,"slug":"size-chart-fit-prediction-model","title":"尺码表与合身预测模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/apparel-size-fit-recommendation-returns-reduction/size-data-fit-model/size-chart-fit-prediction-model","wordCount":3060,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"尺码表与合身预测模型\">尺码表与合身预测模型</h1><p>跨境服装退货里最常见的理由是「尺码不合适」，而它背后往往不是消费者选错，是商家给的信息根本不足以让人选对。一件标注 M 的针织衫，在同一个平台的不同供应商手里，胸围可以差 6 厘米；同一件衣服卖给美国买家和日本买家，标签上的 M 指向的是两套完全不同的身体尺寸区间。真正能降低尺码退货的，不是把尺码表做得更花哨，而是把「一件衣服的实际尺寸」「一个买家的身体尺寸」「这份偏好如何随品类变化」三者拉进同一个可计算的模型里，让系统给出<strong>合身概率</strong>而不是一个孤立的尺码标签。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从静态尺码表到合身概率\">核心概念：从静态尺码表到合身概率</h2><p>传统尺码表是一张<strong>逐码枚举的测量值表</strong>：S/M/L 各自对应一组胸围、腰围、衣长的成衣尺寸（garment measurement），消费者拿自己的净体尺寸（body measurement）去对照最接近的一行。它的根本缺陷是把「合身」当成一个阈值判定——落在区间里就算合适——而真实的合身是一段<strong>舒适区间</strong>：紧身 T 恤的合理余量（ease）可能只有 0 厘米，一件羽绒服却需要 15 厘米以上的松量。同一个净胸围 96 厘米的人，选对紧身款和选对廓形款，对应的码数完全不同。</p>\n<p>合身预测模型要替换的正是这张静态表：它的输出不是「你该穿 M」，而是「这件具体商品，穿 M 的合身概率是 0.78，穿 L 是 0.19」，由消费者自己权衡偏好（偏紧还是偏松）。这条链路把三类数据缝合起来——商品的成衣尺寸、买家的身体尺寸、历史订单揭示的退货与保留行为——最终收敛成一个可排序的概率。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[商品成衣尺寸&lt;br/&gt;供应商实测/三维量体] --&gt; E[合身预测模型]&#10;  B[买家净体尺寸&lt;br/&gt;自报身高体重/体围/扫描] --&gt; E&#10;  C[历史订单&lt;br/&gt;买码/保留/退货/换码] --&gt; D[合身标签构造]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F{合身概率分布}&#10;  F --&gt;|P 最高| G[推荐首选码]&#10;  F --&gt;|次高| H[推荐备选码/提醒偏码]&#10;  G --&gt; I[下单]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; C\">flowchart TD\n  A[商品成衣尺寸&lt;br/&gt;供应商实测/三维量体] --&gt; E[合身预测模型]\n  B[买家净体尺寸&lt;br/&gt;自报身高体重/体围/扫描] --&gt; E\n  C[历史订单&lt;br/&gt;买码/保留/退货/换码] --&gt; D[合身标签构造]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F{合身概率分布}\n  F --&gt;|P 最高| G[推荐首选码]\n  F --&gt;|次高| H[推荐备选码/提醒偏码]\n  G --&gt; I[下单]\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; C</pre><p>图里从订单回到 <code>C</code> 的回路是这个体系能不能自我改进的关键：每一次「买了 M、退了换 L」都是一条标注样本，告诉模型 M 对这类体型偏小。没有这条回路的模型只能停在静态尺码表上，因为它不知道自己的预测错在哪。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>数据需求</th>\n<th>冷启动表现</th>\n<th>退货下降的可溯源依据</th>\n<th>典型适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态尺码表</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>立即可用</td>\n<td>无（只能靠买家经验）</td>\n<td>低退货品类、新店</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尺码表 + 买家自报身高体重</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>可用但粗</td>\n<td>弱，依赖买家诚实度</td>\n<td>中小商家起步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史订单拟合（协同/回归）</td>\n<td>中（需订单量）</td>\n<td>差（无数据即失效）</td>\n<td>中，可 A/B 验证</td>\n<td>有交易积累的平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品级成衣尺寸 + 单品拟合</td>\n<td>高（需逐款实测）</td>\n<td>中（供应商配合后）</td>\n<td>强，可归因到具体码</td>\n<td>精细化运营品牌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体围测量 + 品类化模型</td>\n<td>很高（体围采集）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>最强</td>\n<td>高客单/高退货品类</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表里每一行的本质区别，是它<strong>把误差压在哪一环</strong>：静态表把误差全推给买家，订单拟合把误差压到「有没有足够样本」，成衣尺寸方案把误差压到「供应商愿不愿意逐款实测」。真实系统通常是后三行的组合，而非纯任何一种。</p>\n<h2 id=\"尺码表的测量基准与跨区转换\">尺码表的测量基准与跨区转换</h2><p>尺码不可比的第一个原因是<strong>测量基准不统一</strong>。同一件衣服，中国国标的胸围按「腋下 2 厘米处水平围量」标注，而不少欧美品牌按「腋下到下摆的中点围量」；衣长是从肩点量还是从后领中点量，会带来 2—4 厘米的固定偏差。若下游模型混用了两套基准的成衣尺寸，学到的余量分布就是错的。工程上必须在入库时统一到一套内部测量协议，并保留原始标注以便追溯。</p>\n<p>第二个原因是<strong>尺码标号的地区差异</strong>。这不是「尺码表要翻译」的问题，而是同一标号背后的数值区间不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标号体系</th>\n<th>女装胸围参考（厘米）</th>\n<th>常见标注</th>\n<th>换算风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>美码 US</td>\n<td>4 码约 84、8 码约 90</td>\n<td>0/2/4/6/8</td>\n<td>偶数码 + 部分半码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧码 EU</td>\n<td>36 码约 84、38 码约 88</td>\n<td>34/36/38/40</td>\n<td>与美码差 2 个号左右</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>英码 UK</td>\n<td>8 码约 84、12 码约 92</td>\n<td>6/8/10/12</td>\n<td>与美码差 4 个号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日码 JP</td>\n<td>7 号约 80、11 号约 88</td>\n<td>5/7/9/11/13</td>\n<td>奇数码，整体偏小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>亚洲码/中国 GB</td>\n<td>160/84A 等</td>\n<td>以身高+围度标注</td>\n<td>与欧码差 1—2 码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（数值为行业常见口径，具体因品牌与品类而异。）正因如此，跨境商品上架时若简单把 EU 38 映射成 US 8，退货就会集中爆发——中国国标 <code>GB/T 1335</code> 系列用「身高/胸围 + 体型代号（Y/A/B/C）」标注，本身不是欧美那套数字码。稳妥做法是<strong>存净体尺寸区间而非标号</strong>：模型内部只认「这件商品的 M 码适配净胸围 88—94 厘米」，对外展示时再按访问者地区渲染成当地标号。这样即使换算表更新，也只改渲染层，不动模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从体型测量到合身概率-模型的输入与标签\">从体型测量到合身概率：模型的输入与标签</h2><p>合身预测模型的输入可以粗分为两块：<strong>身体向量</strong>与<strong>商品向量</strong>。</p>\n<p>身体向量的精度直接决定上限。自报身高体重是最低成本的采集方式，但它只能粗略推出体型，且用户常有偏差（普遍少报体重）。更准的是关键体围（胸围、腰围、臀围、肩宽、内长）——这类数据要么靠买家自己量（配合图文引导），要么靠手机端的三维重建。三维体围提取在 2020 年代已经商品化：早期方案需要专用扫描仓，其后转向「手机两视图 + 统计体型模型（SMPL 及后续人体参数化模型）拟合」，能在几秒内输出围度估计。要注意的是，手机重建的<strong>围度绝对误差</strong>通常仍有 1—3 厘米量级，对紧身品类需要额外余量校正，而不是当作精确值直用。</p>\n<p>商品向量则来自成衣尺寸，理想状态是<strong>逐款实测</strong>（供应商按协议测量并上传），退而求其次是按版型类目回填。这里必须显式建模<strong>松量（ease）</strong>：合身与否是「成衣尺寸 − 净体尺寸」落在该品类的舒适区间内，而非单纯看成衣尺寸。</p>\n<p>标签怎么来，是这套系统里最容易被低估的一步。真实可信的合身标签只有三个来源：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>保留信号</strong>：订单签收后未退货、未换码，且订单处于退货窗口之外——记为「该码合身」。</li>\n<li><strong>换码信号</strong>：买家退货理由为尺码，且换购了另一个码——记为「原码偏小/偏大，目标码合身」，是最强的成对样本。</li>\n<li><strong>显式反馈</strong>：买家评价「穿着偏紧/正好/偏松」——噪声大但覆盖广。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>标签构造要把这三者统一成同一种标注，例如「相对净体尺寸的合身偏差」，才能被同一模型学习。</p>\n<h2 id=\"特征工程与合身概率建模\">特征工程与合身概率建模</h2><p>把上面两块拼起来，模型的骨架其实不复杂，难在特征与校准。一组可落地的特征包括：净体围度与目标码成衣围度之差（余量）、品类（针织/梭织/牛仔的回弹与容差不同）、版型标签（修身/常规/宽松）、面料的弹性系数、买家历史退货率与偏好偏移、以及商品的历史退货率。用余量与品类交互项，往往比堆模型复杂度更有效。</p>\n<p>一个务实的建模方式是把问题降级成<strong>成对比较（pairwise）</strong>：与其直接预测绝对合身度，不如学「对这位买家，M 与 L 哪个更可能合身」。给定净胸围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>、商品 M 码成衣胸围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>M</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、余量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_M = g_M - b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，一个带品类容差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的可解释打分可以是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(M) = \\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{(e_M - \\mu_c)^2}{2\\sigma_c^2}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4411em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.933em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该品类「最舒适余量」的均值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是它的容差宽度。再对全部码归一化得到合身概率</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(M) = \\frac{s(M)}{\\sum_{k} s(k)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4127em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个形式的优点是<strong>可解释、可冷启动、可人工校准</strong>：新品没有订单时用品类先验的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_c,\\sigma_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 也能给出推荐；有订单后则用逻辑回归或梯度提升模型，以余量、品类、买家特征为输入直接学 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(M)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，再把上面的公式作为先验特征喂进去。工业界两者通常是混合的——先验兜底冷启动，模型负责个性化。</p>\n<p>志愿性差（voluntary fit）也要建模：同一净体尺寸的人，在紧身裙上和大衣上的偏好完全不同，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须按品类分别估计，而不是全局一个值。忽略了这一层，模型会把「喜欢宽松」的人一律推大一码，反而制造新的退货。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冷启动-尺码体系漂移与模型评估\">冷启动、尺码体系漂移与模型评估</h2><p>合身模型的三个长期难题是<strong>冷启动、漂移和评估</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>冷启动</strong>：新商品没有订单、新买家没有历史。解法是用层级先验——同品牌同版型的其他款、同品类其他品牌的余量分布——先给一个合理的推荐，再用首批订单快速修正。关键是让推荐系统<strong>显式暴露不确定性</strong>：样本不足时提示「参考同类商品，建议偏大一码」，而不是假装知道自己不知道的事。</p>\n<p><strong>漂移</strong>：供应商换面料、换版师，同一款的名义尺码对应的实际成衣尺寸会漂移；平台尺码体系若中途调整，历史标签的口径也会变。工程上要定期抽检成衣尺寸，把尺寸漂移作为模型监控指标；标签口径变更必须版本化，避免新旧标签混训。</p>\n<p><strong>评估</strong>：不能用准确率，因为「合身」的负样本极少（大多数订单其实合身）。实用的指标是<strong>退货率下降</strong>与<strong>换码率下降</strong>，且必须用 A/B 对照与增量口径——推荐生效后总退货里尺码类占比是否真的降低，而不是把「推荐过的订单退货少」当成功劳（推荐本就偏向老客和高确定性商品）。一个稳健的做法是把尺码相关退货率作为北极星，同时监控推荐覆盖率与首选码采纳率，防止模型为了保守而永远推「最保险的中间码」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>合身预测模型的输出是<strong>概率分布而非孤立标号</strong>，它替换的是静态尺码表的阈值式判定。</li>\n<li>三类数据缺一不可：商品成衣尺寸、买家净体尺寸、历史订单的保留/换码信号；订单回路决定模型能否自我修正。</li>\n<li>尺码不可比源于<strong>测量基准不统一</strong>与<strong>标号地区差异</strong>，稳妥做法是内部只存净体尺寸区间，对外再按地区渲染标号。</li>\n<li>松量（ease）与品类容差是合身的核心变量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_c,\\sigma_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须按品类分别估计。</li>\n<li>手机三维重建的围度仍有 1—3 厘米误差，紧身品类需额外校正，不能当精确值直用。</li>\n<li>评估看尺码相关退货率的<strong>增量</strong>而非准确率，并监控覆盖率与跨度，防止模型退化为保守的中间码预测器。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>商品侧的尺码信息如何被结构化成可计算的属性、以及如何跨供应商对齐，是下游推荐的前置条件；这套属性模型见 <a href=\"../product-attribute-size-ontology/apparel-size-ontology-schema\">商品尺寸属性与尺码体系建模</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"尺码表与合身预测模型","id":"尺码表与合身预测模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从静态尺码表到合身概率","id":"核心概念-从静态尺码表到合身概率"},{"level":2,"text":"尺码表的测量基准与跨区转换","id":"尺码表的测量基准与跨区转换"},{"level":2,"text":"从体型测量到合身概率：模型的输入与标签","id":"从体型测量到合身概率-模型的输入与标签"},{"level":2,"text":"特征工程与合身概率建模","id":"特征工程与合身概率建模"},{"level":2,"text":"冷启动、尺码体系漂移与模型评估","id":"冷启动-尺码体系漂移与模型评估"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"人体测量与体型数据建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/apparel-size-fit-recommendation-returns-reduction/size-data-fit-model/anthropometric-sizing-data-model"},"next":{"title":"合身模型评估与偏差校正","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/apparel-size-fit-recommendation-returns-reduction/size-data-fit-model/fit-model-evaluation-bias-correction"}}